    narr:generatedFrom "7d32209899aeee9cc14c2a4ae9fb30d3ac68438d" ;
    narr:narration """On 2026-07-25, Quinton Fairweather imposed a concrete operational-resilience cadence — [monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1) — and immediately warranted it with a principle: [an unrehearsed rollback is one you do not actually have](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2). The two utterances move from decision to conviction: the first is a dated, forward-looking mandate; the second is an abstract, present-tense maxim that makes rehearsal constitutive of capability rather than merely prudent. A [composite reported-speech frame](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3) records both segments as one utterance, with XenaExpertgh voicing the frame and Quinton signing as principal — the gap between voicer and signer marking where authority is recorded versus where it rests. Metadata children fix the [cadence](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4) and [ownership](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_5) of the practice. A [broader narrative](narr:Narrative_RehearsalConstitutesCapability) generalizes the claim: readiness is constituted by rehearsal, not by assertion — framing the specific Atlas decision as an instance of a leader treating unpracticed recovery as nonexistent and warranting that treatment.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RehearsalConstitutesCapability> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Atlas rollback rehearsals run monthly from now on." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Cadence**: monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "an unrehearsed capability is no capability at all" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RehearsalConstitutesCapability> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The concrete mandate (monthly cadence) and the abstract principle (unrehearsed = nonexistent) sit in different temporal and conviction registers — decision versus maxim — leaving open whether the cadence exhausts the principle or merely instantiates it." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RehearsalConstitutesCapability> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The composite frame is voiced by XenaExpertgh but signed by Quinton as principal — the recording voice and the authority voice are not the same person, so the utterance's footing depends on which attribution you read." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.2" .
